            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Edição Deluxe digital</h1><p>Pre order the digital deluxe edition and receive Markov, the Russian character free as an exclusive in game character! Coming with a 1 of a kind Ak-47 with higher damage, better accuracy and a 55 round magazine!<br>Also receive the Season Pass that grants you access to all paid for dlc, and exclusive items after launch!</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><strong>NoMansLand</strong><br>No Mans Land is a poly art Zombie Survival game. You can craft,<br>loot and shoot your way around the map. Play alone, or with a<br>group of people. Choose how you lived your life previously, and<br>make your way into a new life, living along side the zombies. Just<br>remember to sleep with one eye open!<br><br><strong>Craft!</strong><br>Craft up to 40 different items including<br>-weapons<br>-fortifications<br>-food<br>-drink<br>-health items<br>and many many more!<br><br><strong>Explore!</strong><br>Explore a vast and changing landscape as you wonder through Candigo City. <br>Explore the industrial district, the marina, the Military outpost and many other locations<br><br><strong>Survive</strong><br>Your ultimate goal is to survive! You have no other option, its you or them! Fight for your survival, make allies but<br>never let anyone close enough to kill you! Its you, your gear and your instinct that will keep you alive.",
            "about_the_game": "<strong>NoMansLand</strong><br>No Mans Land is a poly art Zombie Survival game. You can craft,<br>loot and shoot your way around the map. Play alone, or with a<br>group of people. Choose how you lived your life previously, and<br>make your way into a new life, living along side the zombies. Just<br>remember to sleep with one eye open!<br><br><strong>Craft!</strong><br>Craft up to 40 different items including<br>-weapons<br>-fortifications<br>-food<br>-drink<br>-health items<br>and many many more!<br><br><strong>Explore!</strong><br>Explore a vast and changing landscape as you wonder through Candigo City. <br>Explore the industrial district, the marina, the Military outpost and many other locations<br><br><strong>Survive</strong><br>Your ultimate goal is to survive! You have no other option, its you or them! Fight for your survival, make allies but<br>never let anyone close enough to kill you! Its you, your gear and your instinct that will keep you alive.",
